Example assertion (aws idempotency):

```ts
await ingestAwsEntitlementEvent(fx.activateHosted, { requestId: 'req_1' });
await ingestAwsEntitlementEvent(fx.activateHosted, { requestId: 'req_2' }); // duplicate delivery

const ent = await db.marketplaceEntitlements.findUnique({ where: { externalEntitlementId: fx.activateHosted.entitlementId } });
expect(ent?.state).toBe('ACTIVE');

const audit = await db.auditLogs.findMany({ where: { entityId: ent!.id, action: { in: ['MARKETPLACE_ENTITLEMENT_CREATED','MARKETPLACE_ENTITLEMENT_DUPLICATE'] } } });
expect(audit.filter(a => a.action === 'MARKETPLACE_ENTITLEMENT_CREATED')).toHaveLength(1);
expect(audit.filter(a => a.action === 'MARKETPLACE_ENTITLEMENT_DUPLICATE')).toHaveLength(1);
```

Retry harness avoids sleep by advancing a fake clock and asserting attempt counts + final outcome.
